WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.271
Not every request needs the same response Apply the

00:00:04.284 --> 00:00:07.836
four checks from the previous activity to specific requests

00:00:08.757 --> 00:00:11.731
An everyday internal meeting change may be within an

00:00:11.731 --> 00:00:16.573
agreed delegation A bank-detail change is a different decision

00:00:16.942 --> 00:00:19.770
even if the same person can edit both records

00:00:20.678 --> 00:00:23.165
We will choose a response to the exact action

00:00:23.218 --> 00:00:28.126
and its conditions In this teaching edition United States

00:00:28.192 --> 00:00:33.836
dollars USD replace the original case denomination The fictional

00:00:33.836 --> 00:00:38.192
limit remains 2,000 with the same conditions This is

00:00:38.192 --> 00:00:42.113
a teaching localization not an exchange-rate conversion or a

00:00:42.231 --> 00:00:44.073
real workplace spending policy
